==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paradox Rift|Lokix|122}} from the {{TCG|Paradox Rift}} expansion.
*'''Rocket Jump''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fates Collide|Spoink|30}} from the {{TCG|Fates Collide}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

